WEBVTT

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:08.990
Hoshimi Productions

00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:12.660
My heart is beating so fast.

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:14.990
There must be something...

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:23.870
Are you okay?

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:26.740
Thanks...

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:37.330
She seemed really cool...

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:39.700
Hoshimi Productions

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:47.330
Thank you very much!

00:00:52.660 --> 00:00:55.370
All right next, #4...

00:00:55.370 --> 00:00:56.450
Huh?!

00:00:56.450 --> 00:00:57.580
Yes.

00:00:57.580 --> 00:00:59.910
I'm #4, Kotono Nagase.

00:00:59.910 --> 00:01:01.290
Nagase...?

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:03.580
H-Hey!

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:09.160
All right, come on in.

00:01:11.580 --> 00:01:15.200
Kotono Nagase... By any chance...

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:17.540
I'm Mana Nagase's sister.

00:01:17.540 --> 00:01:19.200
Mana's...?

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:23.120
What's the matter?

00:01:23.120 --> 00:01:24.410
Nothing.

00:01:24.410 --> 00:01:27.410
You're Mr. Shinji Saegusa, right?

00:01:27.410 --> 00:01:30.490
You managed my sister from the beginning.

00:01:30.490 --> 00:01:32.200
So what?

00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:35.370
Please guide me as you did her.

00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:38.540
I'm determined to make it through
any harsh training.

00:01:38.540 --> 00:01:42.410
For this audition, I'm leaving
everything up to this guy.

00:01:42.410 --> 00:01:44.080
I'm Kohei Makino.

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:46.790
I'll be in charge if you pass the audition.

00:01:47.950 --> 00:01:51.120
You won't be in charge, Mr. Saegusa?

00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:54.040
Of course we'll take care of you as the agency.

00:01:54.040 --> 00:01:57.160
But Makino will be your direct manager.

00:01:59.330 --> 00:02:01.490
First, let me ask you this:

00:02:01.490 --> 00:02:04.410
Why do you want to become an idol?

00:02:04.410 --> 00:02:07.490
I'm Mana Nagase's sister.

00:02:07.490 --> 00:02:10.490
Isn't that enough of a reason?

00:02:10.490 --> 00:02:13.740
I want to stand at the top of the Venus Program.

00:02:13.740 --> 00:02:15.950
That's my goal.

