Nagase...?

00:04:16.120 --> 00:04:17.990
H-Hey!

00:04:19.160 --> 00:04:21.620
Why would she leave?

00:04:22.620 --> 00:04:24.620
What's going on?

00:04:24.620 --> 00:04:26.160
It's nothing...

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:30.120
If you pass, we'll have you
move into the company dorms.

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:31.370
Is that all right?

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:34.120
I'm able to commute from home.

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:36.200
It's our policy.

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:39.620
We want you to utilize what you gain
from living with other members

00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:42.740
and deepening your understanding
for each other.

