00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:50.660
My sister was a solo artist.

00:04:51.950 --> 00:04:56.910
My sister made it all the way to the
Next Venus Grand Prix finals by herself.

00:04:56.910 --> 00:04:59.200
I'd like to be a solo artist, too.

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:00.950
You're...

00:05:00.950 --> 00:05:02.490
I see.

00:05:02.490 --> 00:05:06.540
Still, I don't plan to change
anything about this project.

00:05:06.540 --> 00:05:08.040
If you can't agree to the terms,

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:12.290
you're more than welcome to pull out
before the results come in.

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:14.580
This concludes today's audition.

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:17.790
The results will be mailed out at a later date.

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:19.830
Do you have any questions for me?

00:05:21.910 --> 00:05:23.410
I don't.

00:05:27.540 --> 00:05:28.990
Excuse me...

00:05:28.990 --> 00:05:30.740
Miss Haruko, what is it?

00:05:30.740 --> 00:05:32.120
Wow!

00:05:32.120 --> 00:05:33.580
Is this a studio?

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:34.950
Who is this?

00:05:34.950 --> 00:05:39.620
She just came into our office,
so I assumed she was an auditioner...

00:05:39.620 --> 00:05:42.660
She's the last one for the morning half.

00:05:42.660 --> 00:05:44.540
What's your number?

00:05:44.540 --> 00:05:45.910
My number?

00:05:45.910 --> 00:05:48.540
Where am I right now?

00:05:48.540 --> 00:05:50.790
We're a talent agency.

00:05:50.790 --> 00:05:52.540
Talent...

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:54.620
Like, for idols?

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:56.040
That's right.

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:58.290
You're the girl from earlier!

00:05:58.290 --> 00:06:01.040
So, you're going to become an idol?

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:03.040
It hasn't been decided yet.

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:05.870
The audition just ended.

00:06:05.870 --> 00:06:07.450
Audition...

00:06:07.450 --> 00:06:08.790
I see.

00:06:08.790 --> 00:06:12.290
I'm sorry, it was my misunderstanding.

00:06:12.290 --> 00:06:13.910
Come on, let's go.

00:06:13.910 --> 00:06:18.120
Actually... May I audition, too?

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:21.240
You're supposed to pass
a screening before that--

00:06:21.240 --> 00:06:22.240
You.

00:06:22.240 --> 00:06:23.080
What's your name?

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:24.080
Huh?

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:25.290
What?

00:06:25.290 --> 00:06:26.950
It's Sakura Kawasaki.

00:06:26.950 --> 00:06:32.160
I'm able to tell what's important
and necessary for me.

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:34.370
What do you mean by that?

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:36.790
My heart lets me know.

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:39.580
It directs me to places and to take action.

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:43.330
My heart's never let me down before.

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:45.370
So, that's why you're here?

00:06:45.370 --> 00:06:46.700
Yes!

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:50.910
My beating heart led me here
and I bumped into her.

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:54.200
My heart hasn't stopped pounding ever since!

00:06:54.200 --> 00:06:56.540
It must be telling me to become an idol!

00:06:56.540 --> 00:06:57.910
You gotta be kidding me.

00:06:58.910 --> 00:07:04.410
You have no idea how many girls
are working hard to get into this world.

00:07:04.410 --> 00:07:08.660
You have no idea how many girls
can't even get a chance...

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:13.490
This isn't a world you can enter
with such a ridiculous reason.

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:17.580
It's not ridiculous. This is what I believe.

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:19.830
I believe in my heart.

00:07:19.830 --> 00:07:23.410
As she said, the idol world is a severe place.

00:07:23.410 --> 00:07:28.160
Nowadays, your ability gets
quantified by the Venus Program.

00:07:28.160 --> 00:07:30.330
There's a clear split between
winners and losers,

00:07:30.330 --> 00:07:32.620
so you can say it's become
as harsh as ever.

00:07:32.620 --> 00:07:38.370
We're doing this audition to judge whether you
got what it takes to survive in such a world.

00:07:38.370 --> 00:07:42.870
Even if you sign with us, there's
no guarantee that you will succeed.

00:07:42.870 --> 00:07:45.240
Now, do you still want to audition?

00:07:45.240 --> 00:07:46.910
Yes!

00:07:46.910 --> 00:07:48.620
So what can you do?

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:53.490
I can sing!

00:07:53.490 --> 00:07:55.160
Will you sing for us now?

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:56.290
Yes!

00:08:01.490 --> 00:08:05.740
♬ The story begins now ♬

00:08:05.740 --> 00:08:10.120
♬ Like dancing flower petals ♬

00:08:10.120 --> 00:08:18.740
♬ Let's hurry and run towards
the future with light steps! ♬

00:08:18.740 --> 00:08:22.990
♬ The glory I dreamed about ♬

00:08:22.990 --> 00:08:26.160
♬ In order to achieve it ♬

00:08:26.160 --> 00:08:28.160
♬ I'll keep my face up ♬

00:08:28.160 --> 00:08:29.950
♬ Face forward ♬

00:08:29.950 --> 00:08:31.080
♬ Ready! ♬

00:08:31.080 --> 00:08:35.580
♬ I make my wish through
this song and go forward ♬

00:08:35.580 --> 00:08:38.660
♬ First step ♬

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:43.200
Oh my goodness.

00:08:43.200 --> 00:08:46.870
You sounded just like Mana.

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:50.410
I wasn't good at singing when I was little.

00:08:50.410 --> 00:08:54.700
But one day, I woke up, being able to sing!

00:08:54.700 --> 00:08:56.490
Yeah, I know.

00:08:57.490 --> 00:09:00.080
Makino?

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:03.540
Why did you run off like that earlier?

00:09:03.540 --> 00:09:06.660
Seeing Kotono surprised me.

00:09:06.660 --> 00:09:08.290
Still...

00:09:08.290 --> 00:09:10.160
I wasn't expecting it.

00:09:10.160 --> 00:09:11.620
And...

00:09:11.620 --> 00:09:16.080
When I think about how much grief
I put her through...

00:09:16.080 --> 00:09:18.040
I felt too ashamed...

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:24.620
But I never thought Kotono
would aim to become an idol.

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:28.290
She's matured a lot since I last saw her, too.

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:30.880
But you came back to check on her anyway...

00:09:30.370 --> 00:09:31.540
It's not like that.

00:09:32.540 --> 00:09:36.290
I wanted to leave Kotono up to you, Makino.

00:09:36.290 --> 00:09:38.620
But then I heard that girl's singing...

00:09:38.620 --> 00:09:40.330
Sakura Kawasaki's?

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:43.450
Yup. It got me really curious...

00:09:43.450 --> 00:09:45.450
So I came back.

00:09:45.450 --> 00:09:48.950
I thought her singing sounded a lot like yours.

00:09:48.950 --> 00:09:52.120
Really? I can't tell myself.

00:09:53.950 --> 00:09:57.040
You knew about Kotono and didn't tell me.

00:09:57.040 --> 00:10:00.370
You're the one who chose
not to look at the resumes.

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:02.040
Still...

00:10:02.040 --> 00:10:07.370
Mana's biological sister and a
mysterious girl with Mana's voice...

00:10:07.370 --> 00:10:08.740
So what's your verdict?

00:10:08.740 --> 00:10:13.410
I bet you're getting a kick
out of this, Mr. Saegusa.

00:10:13.410 --> 00:10:15.620
You're the one responsible.

00:10:15.620 --> 00:10:16.910
Yes.

00:10:20.410 --> 00:10:22.350
"Kotono Nagase
Confidential
Audition Results
DO NOT BEND"

00:10:22.350 --> 00:10:23.490
"Acceptance Letter
'Newcomer Discovery Project' Results
Thank you for applying to the
'Newcomer Discovery Project.'

00:10:33.540 --> 00:10:35.540
Kotono!

00:10:39.330 --> 00:10:41.990
Looking forward to working with you!

00:10:41.990 --> 00:10:43.620
You, too.

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:47.040
<i>Idoly Pride.</i>

00:10:49.200 --> 00:10:52.540
I'm Kotono Nagase.
I look forward to working with you.

00:10:52.540 --> 00:10:55.990
I'm Sakura Kawasaki.
I look forward to working with you!

00:10:55.990 --> 00:10:58.410
Makino is in charge of both of you.

00:10:58.410 --> 00:11:03.410
There will be many challenges ahead, but I hope
to work hard and conquer them together.

00:11:03.410 --> 00:11:04.790
Welcome aboard.

00:11:04.790 --> 00:11:05.790
Thank you!

00:11:07.290 --> 00:11:11.410
Makino used to be Mana's assistant manager.

00:11:11.410 --> 00:11:12.620
What?

00:11:12.620 --> 00:11:16.410
Mana's the one who brought Makino here, right?

00:11:16.410 --> 00:11:17.910
She did?

00:11:17.910 --> 00:11:20.080
Well, it's a long story...

00:11:20.080 --> 00:11:24.910
It just so happened that we sat next to
each other in class, so it was easy to ask.

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:28.830
Um... Kotono's sister... Is it by any chance...?

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:31.660
Yeah, I'll explain later.

00:11:31.660 --> 00:11:34.160
Now, I'll give you both a tour of the office.

00:11:34.160 --> 00:11:35.620
You can leave your things there.

00:11:35.620 --> 00:11:37.200
Okay!

00:11:51.790 --> 00:11:53.540
So that's the story.

00:11:53.540 --> 00:11:55.990
Kotono is Mana's...!

00:11:55.990 --> 00:11:59.910
Anyway, I heard about your
health condition from your parents...

00:11:59.910 --> 00:12:01.160
Yes.

00:12:15.200 --> 00:12:16.370
I give up!

00:12:20.620 --> 00:12:22.790
I'm no good at all.

00:12:22.790 --> 00:12:25.540
You never break out of the pose.
It's impressive, Kotono!

00:12:25.540 --> 00:12:28.120
I do basic training regularly.

00:12:28.120 --> 00:12:29.620
I see!

00:12:29.620 --> 00:12:31.950
As for me...

00:12:31.950 --> 00:12:34.990
I was never the athletic type.

00:12:34.990 --> 00:12:37.580
Do you think you can really make it like that?

00:12:37.580 --> 00:12:38.580
Yup!

00:12:38.580 --> 00:12:42.160
I believe in what I felt in my heart that day.

00:12:44.740 --> 00:12:46.870
Did they tell you about me?

00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:49.740
Yup, from Mr. Makino.

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:51.040
What did you think?

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:52.160
I was surprised!

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:54.240
Kotono, you're the Mana Nagase--

00:12:54.240 --> 00:12:57.040
I mean, Miss Mana's little sister.

00:12:57.040 --> 00:13:01.410
Even I know who she is, when I
don't know much about idols.

00:13:01.410 --> 00:13:05.200
You sang my sister's song at the audition.

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:07.990
Yup! I really like that song.

00:13:07.990 --> 00:13:12.330
But what a coincidence that this was her agency!

00:13:13.370 --> 00:13:18.450
If we were to make our debut,
does that make us Miss Mana's juniors?

00:13:19.540 --> 00:13:22.410
She's not here anymore.

00:13:22.410 --> 00:13:24.450
Kotono...

00:13:24.450 --> 00:13:27.620
Your regular lessons will start tomorrow.

00:13:27.620 --> 00:13:28.450
Yes!

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:33.490
And you'll be moving into the dorms soon,
so be prepared.

00:13:33.490 --> 00:13:34.790
Understood!

00:13:34.790 --> 00:13:38.290
You'll meet the other members soon, too.

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:39.870
I can't wait!

00:13:40.950 --> 00:13:43.620
Thank you for today!

00:13:43.620 --> 00:13:47.120
I'm so curious about the other members!

00:13:47.120 --> 00:13:48.830
Aren't you?

00:13:48.830 --> 00:13:49.990
Not really.

00:13:49.990 --> 00:13:53.160
I wanted to be a solo artist originally.

00:13:53.160 --> 00:13:54.290
I see.

00:13:54.290 --> 00:13:56.200
Miss Mana was, too, right?

00:14:02.620 --> 00:14:03.950
Hey, Big Sister...

00:14:03.950 --> 00:14:05.700
Who are they?

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:09.580
Big Sister...?

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:15.450
I've decided that I want to be in the industry,
become an idol!

00:14:15.450 --> 00:14:17.620
That came out of nowhere.

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:19.410
It can't be that easy to be--

00:14:19.410 --> 00:14:20.740
Sure it is!

00:14:20.740 --> 00:14:24.290
I was scouted by a famous
producer the other day!

00:14:25.290 --> 00:14:26.790
I'm home.

00:14:26.790 --> 00:14:28.490
Where's Big Sister?

00:14:28.490 --> 00:14:31.290
She said it's another late night at work.

00:14:35.120 --> 00:14:36.660
What? Kotono said that?

00:14:36.660 --> 00:14:40.120
She thinks your work is getting between you two.

00:14:42.290 --> 00:14:45.080
Will you come see my performance
at the finals tomorrow?

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:47.740
You want me to witness your victory?

00:14:47.740 --> 00:14:51.870
No, there's a song I want you to hear.

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:57.490
Since you became an idol,

00:14:57.490 --> 00:14:59.790
it's been such a nuisance for me.

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:02.200
All they talk about at school is you.

00:15:02.200 --> 00:15:06.290
People hassle me for your autograph
or a chance to meet you...

00:15:06.290 --> 00:15:06.920
Sorry.

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:08.950
Don't apologize.

00:15:10.830 --> 00:15:12.790
If this were the case...

00:15:26.990 --> 00:15:29.410
Yes, this is Nagase.

00:15:31.040 --> 00:15:34.790
Yes... Yes, I'm her younger sister.

00:15:39.740 --> 00:15:40.950
What...?

00:15:52.540 --> 00:15:54.080
A diary...?

00:16:02.830 --> 00:16:04.410
Big Sister...

00:16:06.950 --> 00:16:08.330
Kotono!

00:16:09.450 --> 00:16:11.990
See you later! I'm this way!

00:16:11.990 --> 00:16:14.240
Can't wait for tomorrow!

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:17.870
You don't want me to tell your sister?

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:18.950
What?

00:16:18.950 --> 00:16:24.580
"Your sister has unfinished business,
so she's still lingering around as a ghost"?

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:27.240
I would word it a little differently...

00:16:27.240 --> 00:16:29.870
There's no way you could tell her.

00:16:29.870 --> 00:16:33.950
Kotono's probably trying
to become an idol for me.

00:16:33.950 --> 00:16:38.830
She's trying to achieve the thing I left undone.

00:16:38.830 --> 00:16:41.490
If Kotono's the one who'll take over my dream...

00:16:41.490 --> 00:16:43.540
I can never be happier.

00:16:43.540 --> 00:16:44.740
Mana...

00:16:44.740 --> 00:16:48.910
Since I disappeared,
she got motivated to do this.

00:16:48.910 --> 00:16:50.410
That's why...

00:16:50.410 --> 00:16:55.540
If she actualizes my dream for me,
maybe I can finally rest in peace.

00:16:57.870 --> 00:16:59.790
Field training?

00:16:59.790 --> 00:17:01.830
Yeah, go get ready.

00:17:04.990 --> 00:17:07.040
In front of the train station...?

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:08.410
That's right.

00:17:08.410 --> 00:17:09.740
This place...

00:17:09.740 --> 00:17:11.240
Let's try singing here.

00:17:11.240 --> 00:17:13.120
What? But there's people around...

00:17:13.120 --> 00:17:16.040
You'll eventually sing in front
of even more people.

00:17:16.040 --> 00:17:17.700
It's better to get used to that now.

00:17:17.700 --> 00:17:21.700
But singing on stage and
singing at a place like this is--

00:17:21.700 --> 00:17:22.870
The same.

00:17:22.870 --> 00:17:25.580
The stage isn't something that's provided.

00:17:25.580 --> 00:17:28.700
Wherever you sing becomes the stage.

00:17:30.160 --> 00:17:36.040
This is the place where a certain idol
often came to practice singing.

00:17:36.040 --> 00:17:37.950
Could that "certain idol" be...?

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:39.040
I'll do it.

00:17:39.040 --> 00:17:40.540
Kotono?!

00:17:40.540 --> 00:17:42.790
I would watch her, too, sometimes.

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:45.910
My sister singing here...

00:17:47.700 --> 00:17:50.080
All right, so let's get singing.

00:17:50.080 --> 00:17:51.790
I'll be watching from over there.

00:17:51.790 --> 00:17:54.580
What?! Um... Mr. Makino...

00:17:57.290 --> 00:17:59.370
Sakura, are you ready?

00:17:59.370 --> 00:18:00.790
Y-Yeah!

00:18:05.700 --> 00:18:11.700
♬ I've encountered something I love
from the bottom of my heart ♬

00:18:11.700 --> 00:18:14.080
♬ For the very first time ♬

00:18:14.080 --> 00:18:18.200
♬ This racing heart isn't a coincidence ♬

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:22.410
♬ It's a sign I chose the right path ♬

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:26.790
♬ A healing sakura-colored wind ♬

00:18:26.790 --> 00:18:31.080
♬ Encourages me to push forward ♬

00:18:31.080 --> 00:18:33.240
♬ An unknown path ♬

00:18:33.240 --> 00:18:34.740
♬ I wonder what awaits ♬

00:18:34.740 --> 00:18:40.580
♬ I'm filled with a fluttering sensation ♬

00:18:40.580 --> 00:18:42.330
Kotono...

00:18:42.330 --> 00:18:46.660
♬ The story begins now ♬

00:18:46.660 --> 00:18:50.910
♬ Like dancing flower petals ♬

00:18:50.910 --> 00:18:59.450
♬ Let's hurry and run towards
the future with light steps! ♬

00:18:51.740 --> 00:18:55.490
Sakura's voice... It really sounds like her.

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:03.910
♬ The glory I dreamed about ♬

00:19:03.910 --> 00:19:06.910
♬ In order to achieve it ♬

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:09.290
♬ I'll keep my face up ♬

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:10.870
♬ Face forward ♬

00:19:10.870 --> 00:19:11.950
♬ Ready! ♬

00:19:11.950 --> 00:19:16.490
♬ I make my wish through this song
and go forward ♬

00:19:16.490 --> 00:19:19.540
♬ First step! ♬

00:19:20.580 --> 00:19:22.580
Wow!

00:19:22.580 --> 00:19:24.010
They remind me of Mana.

00:19:24.010 --> 00:19:24.700
Yeah!

00:19:24.700 --> 00:19:27.160
People called her "that girl after school."

00:19:27.160 --> 00:19:30.370
You look just like Mana.

00:19:30.370 --> 00:19:31.830
Y-Yes.

00:19:31.830 --> 00:19:32.910
I'm her sister.

00:19:32.910 --> 00:19:34.330
Oh, really?

00:19:34.330 --> 00:19:38.330
Your singing makes me think of Mana.

00:19:38.330 --> 00:19:39.370
What?

00:19:39.370 --> 00:19:41.830
Best of luck to you both!

00:19:43.080 --> 00:19:46.240
Thank you very much!

00:19:46.240 --> 00:19:50.040
Does my singing really sound like Miss Mana's?

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:52.330
You're not trying to imitate her?

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:56.490
I would listen to her songs, but I never
intentionally tried to sound like her.

00:19:57.660 --> 00:19:59.330
You do sound like her.

00:19:59.330 --> 00:20:01.950
It's the color... or the feel of your voice.

00:20:01.950 --> 00:20:04.580
Even I think so, as her sister.

00:20:04.580 --> 00:20:06.410
Really...

00:20:08.950 --> 00:20:10.910
Wow, it's big!

00:20:10.910 --> 00:20:13.660
It used to be some kind of recreation facility.

00:20:13.660 --> 00:20:16.040
Your things should be delivered already.

00:20:17.240 --> 00:20:18.950
Oh, Mr. Makino.

00:20:18.950 --> 00:20:20.620
Are they...?

00:20:20.620 --> 00:20:24.080
I want to introduce them,
so let's gather in the living room.

00:20:25.870 --> 00:20:27.290
I'm Saki Shiraishi.

00:20:27.290 --> 00:20:28.990
A third-year in high school.

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:32.490
I'm probably the eldest of the members.

00:20:32.490 --> 00:20:34.580
I'm her sister, Chisa Shiraishi.

00:20:34.580 --> 00:20:36.200
It's nice to meet you.

00:20:36.200 --> 00:20:38.290
I am the one and only Suzu Narumiya.

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:41.740
The name Narumiya probably rung a bell for you.

00:20:41.740 --> 00:20:45.830
I am <i>the</i> daughter of the
prestigious Narumiya family.

00:20:48.740 --> 00:20:51.910
What is with the pathetic reaction?!

00:20:51.910 --> 00:20:54.830
You can be a little more impressed, you know?!

00:20:54.830 --> 00:20:57.490
Miss Saki seems more high-class to me.

00:20:57.490 --> 00:20:59.490
I heard that!

00:20:59.490 --> 00:21:01.290
I'm Shizuku Hyodo.

00:21:02.580 --> 00:21:05.120
I'm Sakura Kawasaki, nice to meet you.

00:21:05.120 --> 00:21:06.830
I'm Kotono Nagase.

00:21:06.830 --> 00:21:08.990
Nagase? Are you...?

00:21:08.990 --> 00:21:10.120
I'm her sister.

00:21:10.120 --> 00:21:11.740
I see.

00:21:11.740 --> 00:21:13.290
You look like her.

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:15.540
Huh? What is it?

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:17.740
Go ahead and pick an open room.

00:21:17.740 --> 00:21:20.290
The room next to me should be open, too.

00:21:25.410 --> 00:21:26.240
What's the matter?

00:21:26.240 --> 00:21:29.540
Um... Mr. Makino, will you be staying here, too?

00:21:29.540 --> 00:21:33.870
Yeah, I moved here a little while ago
as sort of a supervisor...

00:21:33.870 --> 00:21:35.990
All girls can be a little--

00:21:35.990 --> 00:21:37.990
Um... What's wrong?

00:21:41.990 --> 00:21:43.240
Huh?

00:21:45.580 --> 00:21:48.700
Why do I have to stay in a shed?

00:21:48.700 --> 00:21:50.330
Well, of course!

00:21:50.330 --> 00:21:52.700
And plus it suits you, Makino.

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:54.160
What does that mean?

00:21:54.160 --> 00:21:57.830
Don't worry, I'll watch over
the girls in the dorm.

00:21:57.830 --> 00:21:59.910
I don't get it.

00:21:59.910 --> 00:22:02.740
It seems like it'll be lively
and fun around here.

00:22:05.160 --> 00:22:07.870
Huh?! What is this?! How do I stop it?

00:22:07.870 --> 00:22:09.540
What?! Oh, no!

00:22:09.540 --> 00:22:12.660
Wait! W-W-Wait a minute! Hold on! Please!

00:22:12.660 --> 00:22:17.080
K-Kotono! Help me!

